WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.986 --> 00:00:12.007
scanned the pool, looking for her friend.

2
00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:17.471
Odette?" she wondered.

3
00:00:19.592 --> 00:00:21.614
Inez was with her cousin Angela.

4
00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:25.196
They had come to watch Odette's swim meet.

5
00:00:27.658 --> 00:00:30.040
Right now all the swimmers were warming up.

6
00:00:31.308 --> 00:00:33.870
But Inez couldn't find Odette anywhere.

7
00:00:39.135 --> 00:00:43.799
"All the swimmers look the same," Inez complained.

8
00:00:43.819 --> 00:00:48.022
"Why do they all wear the same type of swimming gear?"

9
00:00:50.284 --> 00:00:51.125
Angela laughed.

10
00:00:51.886 --> 00:00:53.227
"They all want to win!

11
00:00:54.468 --> 00:00:59.052
So they wear swimsuits and caps that help them move smoothly and quickly through the water.

12
00:01:00.656 --> 00:01:05.318
Swimsuit designers even use computer programs to make the gear more efficient."

13
00:01:07.539 --> 00:01:10.620
Inez suddenly spotted her friend getting out of the pool.

14
00:01:14.462 --> 00:01:15.062
She waved.

15
00:01:15.082 --> 00:01:17.823
"Good luck, Odette!"

16
00:01:19.444 --> 00:01:22.785
Odette waved back before joining her Bluefish teammates.

17
00:01:25.226 --> 00:01:29.848
The youngest swimmers stood near the edge of the pool, waiting for the first event to begin.

18
00:01:31.184 --> 00:01:35.388
Inez and Angela sat down on an empty bench as the horn blew.

19
00:01:35.408 --> 00:01:39.451
"It's cool that you're on your college's swim team," Inez said.

20
00:01:39.471 --> 00:01:42.353
"I'd like to compete too."

21
00:01:42.373 --> 00:01:45.716
"Why don't you try out for the Bluefish?"

22
00:01:46.256 --> 00:01:47.057
Angela asked.

23
00:01:48.418 --> 00:01:51.060
Inez watched the swimmers shooting through the water.

24
00:01:56.384 --> 00:01:57.005
seems hard.

25
00:01:57.425 --> 00:02:00.448
Besides, I love swimming, but I don't want to swim all day long!"

26
00:02:04.596 --> 00:02:07.718
"Swimmers don't just train in the water," Angela said.

27
00:02:07.738 --> 00:02:10.620
"We exercise on land too.

28
00:02:12.981 --> 00:02:15.822
I go to the gym several times a week to lift weights."

29
00:02:15.843 --> 00:02:20.185
"Oh. Do swimmers need to follow a certain diet?"

30
00:02:23.867 --> 00:02:26.729
is important for any athlete," Angela said.

31
00:02:26.749 --> 00:02:32.252
"Before I train or compete, I eat very carefully.

32
00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:37.321
I eat carbohydrates for energy and protein to help my muscles.

33
00:02:39.562 --> 00:02:41.923
Our trainer creates meal plans for our team.

34
00:02:43.684 --> 00:02:45.725
We get to eat a lot of pasta!"

35
00:02:45.745 --> 00:02:50.907
"I guess I could compete then," Inez said with a grin.

36
00:02:50.927 --> 00:02:53.889
"I'm very good at eating pasta!

37
00:02:54.329 --> 00:02:57.150
But I don't like going to bed early," she added.

38
00:02:57.170 --> 00:03:01.492
"Odette says she starts training at six in the morning."

39
00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:10.344
"Many swimmers do train first thing in the morning—that's when pools are available.

40
00:03:11.905 --> 00:03:14.047
And all athletes need a good night's sleep.

41
00:03:15.448 --> 00:03:16.970
This helps us perform our best.

42
00:03:19.272 --> 00:03:22.835
Most swimmers try to get nine or ten hours of sleep each night."

43
00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:30.321
Inez looked up.

44
00:03:31.542 --> 00:03:33.304
The next event was a relay.

45
00:03:34.568 --> 00:03:36.270
Odette stepped over to her lane.

46
00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:39.132
She was the first swimmer for the Bluefish.

47
00:03:39.873 --> 00:03:42.476
The horn blew and the swimmers dived in.

48
00:03:43.316 --> 00:03:50.022
Splash! Odette hit the water and started swimming fast, easily pulling ahead of the other racers.

49
00:03:53.506 --> 00:03:55.808
She flipped at the wall and swam back.

50
00:04:02.912 --> 00:04:04.833
The next Bluefish swimmer dived in.

51
00:04:07.333 --> 00:04:10.094
All around the pool, people clapped and cheered.

52
00:04:10.114 --> 00:04:15.276
"It does seem fun to swim on a team," Inez said.

53
00:04:15.296 --> 00:04:19.417
"It is fun," Angela said.

54
00:04:20.417 --> 00:04:21.797
Then she nudged Inez.

55
00:04:21.817 --> 00:04:26.399
"So what do you think—will you try out for the Bluefish next year?"

56
00:04:26.419 --> 00:04:30.760
"Um Inez thought for a minute and then nodded.

57
00:04:31.998 --> 00:04:33.829
"Yep, I think I'm ready to dive in!"
